{"seq":2,"slug":"bulkhead-isolation","title":"舱壁隔离模式：把故障关进水密舱","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/resilience-engineering-failure-recovery/cascading-failure-and-isolation/bulkhead-isolation","wordCount":2030,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"舱壁隔离模式-把故障关进水密舱\">舱壁隔离模式：把故障关进水密舱</h1><p>一艘货轮船体被钢制隔板划成若干水密舱，某一舱破洞进水，水被挡在那一舱里，船照样浮着。把这套思路搬到服务端，就是舱壁隔离（Bulkhead）：把对不同下游、不同租户、不同业务线的调用各自分配一份独立的并发额度，任何一份额度被打满，溢出的请求当场失败或排队，而不会去抢别人的线程、连接和内存。这个命名直接来自造船业，Azure 架构中心和多篇 2026 年的工程博客都沿用这个比喻（<a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/architecture/patterns/bulkhead\">Microsoft Learn</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-为什么共享池会被一个慢依赖拖垮\">核心概念：为什么共享池会被一个慢依赖拖垮</h2><p>级联故障最典型的剧本是这样的：服务 A 用一个共享线程池同时调用支付、推荐、日志三个下游。某天推荐服务变慢，每个调用从 50ms 涨到 8s。请求还在按原速率涌入，于是池里的线程一个接一个被卡在等推荐返回上，几秒之内整个池被耗尽。此时支付调用根本拿不到线程——它本身完全健康，却因为和推荐共用一个池而一起死掉。一个慢依赖把无关功能全部带走，这就是 2026 年工程文章反复强调的「一个慢查询或无响应的外部 API 耗尽全部线程」（<a href=\"https://oneuptime.com/blog/post/2026-01-30-microservices-bulkhead-pattern/view\">oneuptime 2026-01-30</a>）。</p>\n<p>舱壁的做法是把这一个共享池切成三份独立额度。推荐被打满，只有推荐那份额度里的请求失败，支付和日志的额度纹丝不动。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    C[入站请求] --&gt; R{按下游路由}&#10;    R --&gt;|支付| P[支付舱壁&lt;br/&gt;额度 20]&#10;    R --&gt;|推荐| RC[推荐舱壁&lt;br/&gt;额度 10]&#10;    R --&gt;|日志| L[日志舱壁&lt;br/&gt;额度 5]&#10;    RC --&gt;|额度耗尽| F[快速失败 / 降级]&#10;    P --&gt; OK1[支付下游 健康]&#10;    L --&gt; OK2[日志下游 健康]&#10;    F --&gt; RESP[返回兜底响应&lt;br/&gt;支付不受影响]\">flowchart TD\n    C[入站请求] --&gt; R{按下游路由}\n    R --&gt;|支付| P[支付舱壁&lt;br/&gt;额度 20]\n    R --&gt;|推荐| RC[推荐舱壁&lt;br/&gt;额度 10]\n    R --&gt;|日志| L[日志舱壁&lt;br/&gt;额度 5]\n    RC --&gt;|额度耗尽| F[快速失败 / 降级]\n    P --&gt; OK1[支付下游 健康]\n    L --&gt; OK2[日志下游 健康]\n    F --&gt; RESP[返回兜底响应&lt;br/&gt;支付不受影响]</pre><p>不同隔离手段在隔离强度、开销和适用场景上差异很大，下面这张表是选型时的第一参照：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>隔离层级</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>隔离强度</th>\n<th>额外开销</th>\n<th>典型场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>信号量舱壁</td>\n<td>计数器限制并发，调用跑在当前线程</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>非阻塞 / 响应式调用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>线程池舱壁</td>\n<td>独立线程池 + 有界队列</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>线程切换、内存</td>\n<td>阻塞式 I/O 调用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>连接池隔离</td>\n<td>每依赖独立 DB / HTTP 连接池</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>连接资源</td>\n<td>数据库、外部 API</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>进程 / 容器隔离</td>\n<td>不同 Pod / 容器 / 虚机</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>部署与运维成本</td>\n<td>强隔离的核心业务</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"信号量舱壁与线程池舱壁的取舍\">信号量舱壁与线程池舱壁的取舍</h2><p>Resilience4j 给出了两种实现，二者的边界很清楚（<a href=\"https://resilience4j.readme.io/docs/bulkhead\">resilience4j docs</a>）。信号量舱壁用一个 <code>Semaphore</code> 限制并发数，代码仍跑在调用方自己的线程上，几乎没有额外开销，但它不提供超时排队语义——拿不到许可就立刻被拒。线程池舱壁把调用扔进一个专属线程池，用「有界队列 + 固定线程数」双重控制并发，能把慢调用彻底隔离在自己的线程里，代价是线程上下文切换和额外内存。</p>\n<p>经验法则在 2026 年的文章里收敛得相当一致：非阻塞、响应式的调用优先用信号量舱壁，阻塞式 I/O 用线程池舱壁，再叠加熔断器构成完整的容错链（<a href=\"https://oneuptime.com/blog/post/2026-01-30-microservices-bulkhead-pattern/view\">oneuptime 2026-01-30</a>）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"// 信号量舱壁：仅限并发数，超出即拒&#10;BulkheadConfig semConfig = BulkheadConfig.custom()&#10;    .maxConcurrentCalls(25)&#10;    .maxWaitDuration(Duration.ofMillis(10))   // 拿不到许可最多等 10ms&#10;    .build();&#10;Bulkhead recoBulkhead = Bulkhead.of(&quot;recommendation&quot;, semConfig);&#10;&#10;// 线程池舱壁：独立线程池 + 有界队列&#10;ThreadPoolBulkheadConfig tpConfig = ThreadPoolBulkheadConfig.custom()&#10;    .maxThreadPoolSize(20)&#10;    .coreThreadPoolSize(10)&#10;    .queueCapacity(50)&#10;    .build();&#10;ThreadPoolBulkhead payBulkhead =&#10;    ThreadPoolBulkhead.of(&quot;payment&quot;, tpConfig);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 信号量舱壁：仅限并发数，超出即拒</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">BulkheadConfig semConfig </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> BulkheadConfig.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">custom</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">maxConcurrentCalls</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">25</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">maxWaitDuration</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Duration.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ofMillis</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 拿不到许可最多等 10ms</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">build</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Bulkhead recoBulkhead </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Bulkhead.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"recommendation\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, semConfig);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 线程池舱壁：独立线程池 + 有界队列</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ThreadPoolBulkheadConfig tpConfig </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ThreadPoolBulkheadConfig.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">custom</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">maxThreadPoolSize</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">coreThreadPoolSize</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">queueCapacity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">build</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ThreadPoolBulkhead payBulkhead </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ThreadPoolBulkhead.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"payment\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, tpConfig);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>.NET 生态里 Polly 提供等价的 Bulkhead Isolation 策略，和 Retry、Timeout、Circuit Breaker、Fallback 一起以流式 API 组合，本质思路一致，只是落在不同运行时（<a href=\"https://stackshare.io/hystrix/vs/polly\">stackshare Polly</a>）。需要注意一个长期被踩的坑：信号量舱壁的 <code>maxConcurrentCalls</code> 和底层真实线程池大小必须对齐，否则会出现「信号量放进来的请求比线程池能跑的还多」的错配，社区 issue 里反复讨论过这一点（<a href=\"https://github.com/resilience4j/resilience4j/issues/2023\">resilience4j#2023</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"用-little-定律给舱壁定容量\">用 Little 定律给舱壁定容量</h2><p>舱壁额度拍脑袋设最危险——设小了正常流量被误杀，设大了等于没隔离。Little 定律给出可计算的下界。它的形式是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L = \\lambda \\times W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 是系统中并发处理的请求数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 是平均到达速率（RPS），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 是单请求的平均处理时延（<a href=\"https://davidasync.medium.com/littles-law-tuning-the-thread-pool-size-fedfe4158fb\">davidasync</a>）。</p>\n<p>举例：某下游峰值 5000 RPS，画像显示平均处理 150ms，那么要跟上吞吐至少需要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5000</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>0.15</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>750</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5000 \\times 0.15 = 750</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.15</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">750</span></span></span></span></span> 个并发处理单元（线程 / 协程 / 异步句柄），这就是该舱壁额度的合理下界（<a href=\"https://davidasync.medium.com/littles-law-tuning-the-thread-pool-size-fedfe4158fb\">davidasync</a>）。</p>\n<p>对 CPU 密集型任务，Brian Goetz 在《Java Concurrency in Practice》里给的公式更合适：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>u</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>w</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{threads} = N_{cpu} \\times \\left(1 + \\frac{W_{wait}}{S_{service}}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">ser</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ce</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ai</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>w</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_{wait}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ai</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是等待时间、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{service}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">ser</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ce</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是计算时间。这两条公式给出的是静态估算，问题在于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span>（时延）会随下游退化而漂移：时延上升时本该收缩并发（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 下降），固定额度做不到这点。这正是 2026 年「自适应并发限制」思路兴起的原因——用类似 TCP 拥塞控制的算法，按观测到的时延实时调整额度，而不是死配一个常数（<a href=\"https://www.michal-drozd.com/en/blog/adaptive-concurrency-limits/\">Michal Drozd</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"基础设施层的舱壁-从代码下沉到平台\">基础设施层的舱壁：从代码下沉到平台</h2><p>舱壁不必只活在应用代码里。2026 年的主流实践是把隔离下沉到基础设施层，让平台替业务做这件事。</p>\n<p>在 Kubernetes 里，CPU <code>requests/limits</code> 保证一个 Pod 不会在节点上把其他 Pod 饿死，相当于节点级的资源舱壁；Pod Disruption Budget 则约束「同时最多挂几个副本」——例如结账服务 10 个副本配 <code>minAvailable: 8</code>，运维操作就不会一次驱逐超过 2 个（<a href=\"https://oneuptime.com/blog/post/2026-01-30-kubernetes-bulkhead-infrastructure/view\">oneuptime 2026-01-30 k8s</a>）。</p>\n<p>在服务网格里，Istio 的 <code>DestinationRule</code> 在 sidecar 代理层配置连接数上限、超时和熔断，这本身就是一种连接级舱壁；而限流又分两类：本地限流在每个 Envoy sidecar 上独立计数，每个副本一份额度；全局限流走一个中心化 RLS，由 Envoy 查询它做集群级裁决（<a href=\"https://oneuptime.com/blog/post/2026-02-24-how-to-enable-rate-limiting-in-istio-service-mesh/view\">oneuptime 2026-02-24</a>）。本地限流天然带有「每实例独立额度」的舱壁性质——一个副本被打满不影响其他副本。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[应用层舱壁&lt;br/&gt;Resilience4j / Polly] --&gt; B[网格层舱壁&lt;br/&gt;Istio 连接池 + 本地限流]&#10;    B --&gt; C[编排层舱壁&lt;br/&gt;K8s CPU limits + PDB]&#10;    C --&gt; D[物理隔离&lt;br/&gt;独立节点 / 可用区]&#10;    D --&gt; E[故障爆炸半径&lt;br/&gt;逐层收窄]\">flowchart TD\n    A[应用层舱壁&lt;br/&gt;Resilience4j / Polly] --&gt; B[网格层舱壁&lt;br/&gt;Istio 连接池 + 本地限流]\n    B --&gt; C[编排层舱壁&lt;br/&gt;K8s CPU limits + PDB]\n    C --&gt; D[物理隔离&lt;br/&gt;独立节点 / 可用区]\n    D --&gt; E[故障爆炸半径&lt;br/&gt;逐层收窄]</pre><p>层级越往下，隔离越强、爆炸半径越小，但运维成本也越高。合理的做法是分层叠加而非单点押注。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与熔断-限流的协作边界\">与熔断、限流的协作边界</h2><p>舱壁常被和熔断器混为一谈，但它们解决的是不同问题。舱壁限制的是「同时占用多少资源」，是空间维度的隔离；熔断器盯的是「失败率 / 时延是否越线」，越线就在一段时间内直接短路，是时间维度的快速失败。限流管的则是「入口速率」。三者叠起来才完整：限流挡住过量入口流量，舱壁保证某依赖最多占多少资源、不溢出，熔断在依赖确实坏掉时停止无谓重试（<a href=\"https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/system-design/circuit-breaker-with-bulkhead-isolation-in-microservices/\">GeeksforGeeks</a>）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>控制维度</th>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n<th>典型动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>限流</td>\n<td>入口速率</td>\n<td>RPS 超阈值</td>\n<td>拒绝 / 排队</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>舱壁</td>\n<td>并发资源</td>\n<td>额度耗尽</td>\n<td>快速失败 / 降级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>熔断</td>\n<td>失败率 / 时延</td>\n<td>错误率越线</td>\n<td>短路一段时间</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>落地顺序上，2026 年的建议是先上简单的信号量舱壁，再为阻塞操作加线程池隔离，最后叠熔断器——从轻到重，逐步加固（<a href=\"https://oneuptime.com/blog/post/2026-01-30-microservices-bulkhead-pattern/view\">oneuptime 2026-01-30</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>舱壁隔离的本质是<strong>不共享资源池</strong>：按下游 / 租户 / 业务线切分独立并发额度，让一个慢依赖最多拖垮自己那一份，无关功能照常运行。</li>\n<li>Resilience4j 给出信号量与线程池两种实现：非阻塞调用用信号量（零开销但不排队），阻塞 I/O 用线程池（强隔离但有切换成本）；Polly 在 .NET 提供等价能力。</li>\n<li>额度别拍脑袋：用 Little 定律 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L = \\lambda \\times W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 算下界，CPU 密集型用 Goetz 公式；时延会漂移，因此自适应并发限制正在取代静态常数。</li>\n<li>舱壁可下沉到基础设施层：K8s 的 <code>limits</code> 与 PDB、Istio 的连接池与本地限流，都是不同层级的舱壁，分层叠加逐层收窄爆炸半径。</li>\n<li>舱壁（空间）、限流（入口）、熔断（时间）控制维度不同，组合使用而非互替；落地从信号量舱壁起步，逐步加线程池隔离与熔断。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"舱壁隔离模式：把故障关进水密舱","id":"舱壁隔离模式-把故障关进水密舱"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：为什么共享池会被一个慢依赖拖垮","id":"核心概念-为什么共享池会被一个慢依赖拖垮"},{"level":2,"text":"信号量舱壁与线程池舱壁的取舍","id":"信号量舱壁与线程池舱壁的取舍"},{"level":2,"text":"用 Little 定律给舱壁定容量","id":"用-little-定律给舱壁定容量"},{"level":2,"text":"基础设施层的舱壁：从代码下沉到平台","id":"基础设施层的舱壁-从代码下沉到平台"},{"level":2,"text":"与熔断、限流的协作边界","id":"与熔断-限流的协作边界"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"级联故障的解剖","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/resilience-engineering-failure-recovery/cascading-failure-and-isolation/cascading-failure-anatomy"},"next":{"title":"超时与预算传播：让整条调用链共享同一个\"还剩多久\"","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/resilience-engineering-failure-recovery/cascading-failure-and-isolation/timeout-and-budget-propagation"}}